games are
    "Zelda"
    "Mario"
    "Metroid"

sort games
say games

reverse games
say games

message is "Hello Jeff"
replace "Jeff" with "World" in message
say message

sentence is "one,two,three"
split sentence by "," into parts
say parts

join parts with " - " into joined
say joined

say length of games
say uppercase of message
say lowercase of message
say first of games
say last of games

if message starts with "Hello"
    say "starts-with works"
if message ends with "World"
    say "ends-with works"

find item in games where item is "Mario" into found
say found

say larger of 3 and 8
say smaller of 3 and 8
